><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6th65bqstJ9-e-X_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6562ea2b.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6th65bqstJ9-e-X_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6562.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C7417%2C4947&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6th65bqstJ9-e-X_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6562.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C7417%2C4947&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6th65bqstJ9-e-X_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6562.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C7417%2C4947&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier handing over two parcels to an mother and child at their doorstep. The three are laughing during a pleasant exchange" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Delivery services in Glasgow</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->From bustling areas like the Merchant City and West End to surrounding neighbourhoods like Shawlands and Bearsden, our delivery services in Glasgow are here to make sending parcels quick and hassle-free.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Choose from a Courier collection, ParcelShops, or our 24/7 Lockers to fit your busy schedule. Whether it’s a package headed to Edinburgh, London, or further afield, we offer affordable Standard and Next Day delivery options to suit your needs.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Take a look at our great value prices to see how little it costs to send with Evri in Glasgow. Why not check out our other popular locations, including <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/courier-service-edinburgh" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->delivery services in Edinburgh<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and our <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/courier-service-manchester" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->couriers in Manchester<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon e-button--link card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Our prices" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/our-prices" data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-butt