tion":9,"canonical":10,"subpath1":11,"subpath2":21,"slices":22},"Courier Services Glasgow | Next Day Delivery Glasgow | Evri","Looking for a courier service in Glasgow? Find cheap prices for sending parcels in your area with Evri. Standard and next day delivery options are available.","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service-glasgow",{"id":12,"type":13,"tags":14,"lang":15,"slug":16,"first_publication_date":17,"last_publication_date":17,"uid":16,"link_type":18,"key":19,"isBroken":20},"YhjzRRIAAC8A3CHH","subpath1",[],"en-gb","our-services","2022-02-25T15:18:32+0000","Document","9574e4f3-f61b-41ba-89c3-d77ed9de331a",false,{"link_type":18},[23,45,97,179,254,346,362,374,387,407],{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":26,"primary":36,"id":42,"slice_type":43,"slice_label":44},"horizontalWidget","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[27],{"contentRight":28},{"id":29,"type":30,"tags":31,"lang":15,"slug":32,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"link_type":18,"key":35,"isBroken":20},"ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD","form-v2",[],"from-2.62","2024-03-28T12:02:58+0000","2026-07-09T07:23:30+0000","6b0c7142-6bcb-4106-b21d-6c80563e2a13",{"heading":37,"includeInternational":38,"desktopBackground":39,"tabletBackground":40,"mobileBackground":41},"Courier services in Glasgow",true,{},{},{},"hero_banner$0cd6ed2d-184a-4d94-9411-b770fa8175b2","hero_banner",null,{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":47,"primary":49,"id":95,"slice_type":96,"slice_label":44},"default-slice",[48],{},{"CardImage":50,"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":62,"CardText":63,"ButtonText":91,"ButtonUrl":92,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":51,"alt":54,"copyright":44,"url":55,"id":56,"edit":57},{"width":52,"height":53},1000,667,"An Evri Courier handing over two parcels to an mother and child at their doorstep. The three are laughing during a pleasant exchange","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6th65bqstJ9-e-X_EVRI_LOCATION_05_6562.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=1%2C0%2C7417%2C4947&w=1000&h=667","Z6th65bqstJ9-e-X",{"x":58,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},1,0,"transparent","none","Delivery services in Glasgow",[64,69,72],{"type":65,"text":66,"spans":67,"direction":68},"paragraph","From bustling areas like the Merchant City and West End to surrounding neighbourhoods like Shawlands and Bearsden, our delivery services in Glasgow are here to make sending parcels quick and hassle-free.",[],"ltr",{"type":65,"text":70,"spans":71,"direction":68},"Choose from a Courier collection, ParcelShops, or our 24\u002F7 Lockers to fit your busy schedule. Whether it’s a package headed to Edinburgh, London, or further afield, we offer affordable Standard and Next Day delivery options to suit your needs.",[],{"type":65,"text":73,"spans":74,"direction":68},"Take a look at our great value prices to see how little it costs to send with Evri in Glasgow. Why not check out our other popular locations, including delivery services in Edinburgh and our couriers in Manchester?",[75,83,85,90],{"start":76,"end":77,"type":78,"data":79},152,182,"hyperlink",{"link_type":80,"url":81,"target":82},"Web","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service-edinburgh","_self",{"start":76,"end":77,"type":84},"strong",{"start":86,"end":87,"type":78,"data":88},191,213,{"link_type":80,"url":89,"target":82},"courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service-manchester",{"start":86,"end":87,"type":84},"Our prices",{"link_type":80,"key":93,"url":94},"98b8c0be-e8fd-4202-9fb4-82be5e3af2f5","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Four-prices","card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":98,"version":25,"items":99,"primary":174,"id":177,"slice_type":178,"slice_label":44},"photoListComponent",[100,118,136,155],{"title":101,"content":102,"isNumbered":20,"image":112},"Send a parcel in the UK",[103],{"type":65,"text":104,"spans":105,"direction":68},"Need to send a parcel within the UK? It’s quick and easy with Evri. Choose from ParcelShops, Lockers, or our Courier collection service to get your parcel where it needs to go. Whether it’s a small package or a larger shipment, we’ve got you covered.",[106,111],{"start":107,"end":108,"type":78,"data":109},8,35,{"link_type":80,"url":110,"target":82},"courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend",{"start":107,"end":108,"type":84},{"dimensions":113,"alt":114,"copyright":44,"url":115,"id":116,"edit":117},{"width":52,"height":53},"A female courier is walking up a quiet British street. A brick wall can be seen beside her and she is holding a brown paper parcel in her hand.","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAl5bqstJ9-iNt_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9647.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zAl5bqstJ9-iNt",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"title":119,"content":120,"isNumbered":20,"image":130},"Send a parcel internationally",[121],{"type":65,"text":122,"spans":123,"direction":68},"Looking to send a parcel overseas? With delivery to over 200 countries and territories, our international Courier services are easy and affordable. Visit our international website to learn more about our reliable and cost-effective Courier services, starting from just £6.08.",[124,127],{"start":125,"end":126,"type":84},92,122,{"start":128,"end":129,"type":84},158,179,{"dimensions":131,"alt":44,"copyright":44,"url":132,"id":133,"edit":134},{"width":52,"height":53},"courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2%2C6016%2C4013&w=1000&h=667","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":59,"y":135,"zoom":58,"background":60},2,{"title":137,"content":138,"isNumbered":20,"image":149},"Collect a parcel",[139],{"type":65,"text":140,"spans":141,"direction":68},"Our ParcelShops and Lockers make parcel delivery and collection easy for you. If you or a recipient isn’t available at the time of delivery, you can also choose to divert your incoming packages to a location that suits your schedule. With our ParcelShop to ParcelShop service, you can also send parcels directly from one ParcelShop to another. It’s the cheapest way for you to send and your recipient can collect their parcel any time within opening hours.",[142,148],{"start":143,"end":144,"type":78,"data":145},243,275,{"link_type":80,"url":146,"target":147},"courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fparcelshop-delivery","_blank",{"start":143,"end":144,"type":84},{"dimensions":150,"alt":151,"copyright":44,"url":152,"id":153,"edit":154},{"width":52,"height":53},"Customer is walking away from a ParcelShop, holding their collected parcel in one hand and a store-bought cup of coffee in the other hand.","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"title":156,"content":157,"isNumbered":20,"image":167},"Return a parcel",[158],{"type":65,"text":159,"spans":160,"direction":68},"Need to return an item? Our return a parcel page makes it simple to send your package back to the right retailer. Just enter the retailer’s name to get started and we’ll take care of the rest.",[161,166],{"start":162,"end":163,"type":78,"data":164},28,43,{"link_type":80,"url":165,"target":147},"courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Freturn-a-parcel",{"start":162,"end":163,"type":84},{"dimensions":168,"alt":169,"copyright":44,"url":170,"id":171,"edit":172},{"width":52,"height":53},"ParcelShop store assistant is placing the customer's packageless items into a FSC-approved bag, ready to return to the retailer.","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIz5bqstJ9-TfE_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2344.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&w=1000&h=667","Z6TIz5bqstJ9-TfE",{"x":173,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},47,{"theme":175,"title":176,"description":44},"standard","Send, collect, and return parcels with Evri","list_block$a3df3991-452a-4275-ad05-63ba74761268","list_block",{"variation":180,"version":25,"items":181,"primary":242,"id":252,"slice_type":253,"slice_label":44},"3Column",[182,203,222],{"Title":183,"Description":188,"Image":192,"Label":44,"UrlText":186,"Url":198,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":201,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[184],{"type":185,"text":186,"spans":187},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[189],{"type":65,"text":190,"spans":191,"direction":68},"Ideal for anyone who wants to send, collect, and return parcels in one place, our 9,000+ local ParcelShops even let you print your parcel labels in-store for free. Use our ParcelShop Finder to locate your most convenient store. Simply book parcels you want to send online or via the App and drop off at your nearest location.",[],{"dimensions":193,"alt":194,"copyright":44,"url":195,"id":196,"edit":197},{"width":52,"height":53},"Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance.","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"link_type":80,"key":199,"url":200},"142ccfcd-3c53-4099-8d28-77d87494c459","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":202},"Any",{"Title":204,"Description":208,"Image":212,"Label":44,"UrlText":206,"Url":218,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":221,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[205],{"type":185,"text":206,"spans":207},"Lockers",[],[209],{"type":65,"text":210,"spans":211,"direction":68},"Need more flexibility? Our secure Lockers are open 24\u002F7 across Glasgow. Simply book online or via the App, scan your barcode on arrival, and leave your parcel in an available slot for us to collect.",[],{"dimensions":213,"alt":214,"copyright":44,"url":215,"id":216,"edit":217},{"width":52,"height":53},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"link_type":80,"key":219,"url":220},"d930c021-8e44-4d0c-9add-07b45e6c459e","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":202},{"Title":223,"Description":227,"Image":231,"Label":44,"UrlText":237,"Url":238,"buttonDataGtmTrack":44,"SecondaryButtonText":44,"SecondaryButtonUrl":241,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":44,"ShowAppDownloadCta":44},[224],{"type":185,"text":225,"spans":226},"Courier collection",[],[228],{"type":65,"text":229,"spans":230,"direction":68},"Can’t make it to a drop-off point? Our Couriers in Glasgow can collect your parcel directly from your home or workplace. Book online or through the App, and we’ll provide a 1-hour collection window, so you know exactly when to expect us.",[],{"dimensions":232,"alt":233,"copyright":44,"url":234,"id":235,"edit":236},{"width":52,"height":53},"A courier is handing a blue collection receipt to an older woman at her door.","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6ovTJbqstJ9-cSu_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10254.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6ovTJbqstJ9-cSu",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},"Courier Service",{"link_type":80,"key":239,"url":240},"f546b319-58e0-4a41-8c40-81c31364cc93","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":202},{"SectionTitle":243,"SectionDescription":248,"theme":44},[244],{"type":245,"text":246,"spans":247},"heading2","How to send a parcel in Glasgow",[],[249],{"type":65,"text":250,"spans":251,"direction":68},"We’ve made it easy to send parcels in Glasgow with three convenient options:",[],"article_link_module$bed260e1-ff3e-4d98-aae4-b4369a059dae","article_link_module",{"variation":255,"version":25,"items":256,"primary":342,"id":345,"slice_type":178,"slice_label":44},"listComponent",[257,270,282,294,306,318,330],{"title":258,"content":259,"icon":263},"Parcel tracking and notifications",[260],{"type":65,"text":261,"spans":262,"direction":68},"Check on the delivery stages of your parcel with end-to-end tracking for you and your recipient. We'll also send updates to your recipient and a 1-hour delivery window at no extra cost",[],{"dimensions":264,"alt":266,"copyright":44,"url":267,"id":268,"edit":269},{"width":265,"height":265},40,"Phone icon","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"title":271,"content":272,"icon":276},"Parcel cover",[273],{"type":65,"text":274,"spans":275,"direction":68},"Every parcel includes up to £20 free parcel cover.* You can increase the value up to £999 and choose to add a digital signature for extra peace of mind. *excludes Postable parcels",[],{"dimensions":277,"alt":278,"copyright":44,"url":279,"id":280,"edit":281},{"width":265,"height":265},"Money icon","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"title":283,"content":284,"icon":288},"Easy to use tools",[285],{"type":65,"text":286,"spans":287,"direction":68},"Save time and easily book more than one delivery at once using our Bulk Send and Quick Send tools",[],{"dimensions":289,"alt":290,"copyright":44,"url":291,"id":292,"edit":293},{"width":265,"height":265},"Laptop icon","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ff4479625-5e04-45e8-9a20-77fa5893b64e_laptops.svg","Yh96GBIAAC8A-Zss",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"title":295,"content":296,"icon":300},"Flexible printing options",[297],{"type":65,"text":298,"spans":299,"direction":68},"Print your postage labels at home or in-store for FREE using our Print in Store devices",[],{"dimensions":301,"alt":302,"copyright":44,"url":303,"id":304,"edit":305},{"width":265,"height":265},"Printer icon","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"title":307,"content":308,"icon":312},"Stress-free delivery experience",[309],{"type":65,"text":310,"spans":311,"direction":68},"With a 1-hour delivery window, up to 3 delivery attempts, and flexible diversion options, your recipient can enjoy a stress-free service without having to worry about missing their parcel. And the best part? These features come at no extra cost, giving you even greater value.",[],{"dimensions":313,"alt":314,"copyright":44,"url":315,"id":316,"edit":317},{"width":265,"height":265},"Friendly icon","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9fb9d950-2c3e-4a43-a975-c773dd47adf3_friendly.svg","YflB_BEAACEA8pcM",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"title":319,"content":320,"icon":324},"Photo confirmation of delivery",[321],{"type":65,"text":322,"spans":323,"direction":68},"We'll take a photo as proof of when a parcel has been delivered for your peace of mind and so your recipient knows where they can find it",[],{"dimensions":325,"alt":326,"copyright":44,"url":327,"id":328,"edit":329},{"width":265,"height":265},"Camera icon","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9ecd696f-d8c8-4a09-bdab-f2ed97d94895_cameras.svg","Yh96GBIAACkA-Zso",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"title":331,"content":332,"icon":336},"Trusted by big brands",[333],{"type":65,"text":334,"spans":335,"direction":68},"We’re trusted by some of the biggest names in retail like Hello Fresh, John Lewis, Next, Marks & Spencer, Shein, Wayfair and more",[],{"dimensions":337,"alt":338,"copyright":44,"url":339,"id":340,"edit":341},{"width":265,"height":265},"Success icon","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},{"theme":175,"title":343,"description":344},"Why choose Evri?","While we always aim to provide you great value prices, when you send a parcel in Glasgow, or anywhere in the UK, you’ll always receive these easy sending benefits as well:","list_block$214cb5e7-f6a9-4679-b42a-f2810e1163e8",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":347,"primary":348,"id":360,"slice_type":361,"slice_label":44},[],{"title":349,"bodyText":350,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":38,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":44,"buttonLink":354,"image":355},"Are you VAT registered?",[351],{"type":65,"text":352,"spans":353,"direction":68},"Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],{"link_type":202},{"dimensions":356,"alt":44,"copyright":44,"url":357,"id":358,"edit":359},{"width":52,"height":53},"courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&w=1000&h=667","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":135,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},"feature_banner$897d3fa8-f129-47d9-954e-76c75d3ffd4c","feature_banner",{"variation":363,"version":25,"items":364,"primary":366,"id":373,"slice_type":96,"slice_label":44},"cardNoImageWithCta",[365],{},{"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":367,"CardText":368,"ButtonText":44,"ButtonUrl":372,"IsEco":20},"Clear time frames",[369],{"type":65,"text":370,"spans":371,"direction":68},"Whether your parcel is staying in Glasgow or heading elsewhere in the UK, we’ll keep you informed every step of the way. Our 1-hour windows for collections and deliveries ensure you’re always prepared. If your recipient isn’t available, they can easily divert their parcel to a neighbour, safe place, or one of our ParcelShops or Lockers for collection at a more convenient time.",[],{"link_type":202},"card$2385afaf-1b26-424a-815e-856d0d9694cb",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":375,"primary":376,"id":385,"slice_type":386,"slice_label":44},[],{"heading":377,"description":378,"image":379},"We're TRUSTED by our customers & retailers","We provide delivery services for most of the UK's top retail brands, including Next, ASOS, boohoo, Missguided, PrettyLittleThing, John Lewis, Debenhams, eBay and Amazon.",{"dimensions":380,"alt":381,"copyright":44,"url":382,"id":383,"edit":384},{"width":52,"height":53},"View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house.","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":60},"trust_pilot$3b7771b2-bcc8-4603-9499-abfc6d450fac","trust_pilot",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":388,"primary":389,"id":406,"slice_type":96,"slice_label":44},[],{"CardImage":390,"CardAvatar":61,"CardTitle":397,"CardText":398,"ButtonText":402,"ButtonUrl":403,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":391,"alt":393,"copyright":44,"url":394,"id":395,"edit":396},{"width":52,"height":392},665,"An Evri courier in high vis is smiling posing towards the camera with a parcel under their arm. The backdrop is a street of terraced houses in a rural British neighbourhood.","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ69x25bqstJ9-pVF_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1771.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z69x25bqstJ9-pVF",{"x":59,"y":107,"zoom":58,"background":60},"Looking for work in Glasgow? Become a self-employed Evri courier",[399],{"type":65,"text":400,"spans":401,"direction":68},"Discover your ultimate work-life balance by becoming a self-employed courier with Evri in Glasgow. Whether you're after a straightforward side hustle or something closer to full-time work, you can start delivering parcels in your local area quickly and easily—finding a schedule that fits your lifestyle.",[],"Find out more",{"link_type":80,"key":404,"url":405},"c309090f-b0d3-4419-a390-56d0af4b563d","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fglasgow-courier-jobs","card$0ede5e63-62a7-4ed0-9987-d86ae4cf296c",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":408,"primary":445,"id":447,"slice_type":448,"slice_label":44},[409,415,427],{"questionTitle":410,"questionBody":411},"Does Evri deliver to all parts of Glasgow?",[412],{"type":65,"text":413,"spans":414,"direction":68},"We provide delivery services throughout Glasgow, covering areas like the city centre, West End, and suburbs such as Partick, Shawlands, and Bearsden.",[],{"questionTitle":416,"questionBody":417},"Where can I drop off parcels in Glasgow?",[418],{"type":65,"text":419,"spans":420,"direction":68},"With ParcelShops and Lockers across Glasgow, it’s easy to find a location near you using our ParcelShop Finder.",[421,426],{"start":422,"end":423,"type":78,"data":424},93,110,{"link_type":80,"url":425,"target":82},"courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop\u002F",{"start":422,"end":423,"type":84},{"questionTitle":428,"questionBody":429},"Does Evri support businesses in Glasgow?",[430],{"type":65,"text":431,"spans":432,"direction":68},"Yes, we support Glasgow businesses with flexible delivery options, tools to save time booking and managing multiple deliveries, and competitive pricing. Find out more using our frequent sender hub and see what options suit your needs on our Business Accounts page.",[433,438,439,444],{"start":434,"end":435,"type":78,"data":436},177,196,{"link_type":80,"url":437,"target":82},"courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffrequent-sender-hub",{"start":434,"end":435,"type":84},{"start":440,"end":441,"type":78,"data":442},241,258,{"link_type":80,"url":443,"target":82},"courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fbusiness",{"start":440,"end":441,"type":84},{"title":446},"FAQs","frequently_asked_questions$d2a2d970-b49a-4801-a54f-6d6645ef0dca","frequently_asked_questions",[23,45,97,179,254,346,362,374,387,407],{"heroCardContent":451},[452],{"id":29,"uid":44,"url":44,"type":30,"href":453,"tags":454,"first_publication_date":33,"last_publication_date":34,"slugs":455,"linked_documents":456,"lang":15,"alternate_languages":457,"data":458},"courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fapi\u002Fv2\u002Fdocuments\u002Fsearch?ref=alX7JhIAACoAg_QF&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22ZgVcQRIAACEApjZD%22%29+%5D%5D",[],[32],[],[],{"monotypeTitle":459,"heading":468,"headingSupplement":469,"subheading":470,"promoText":471,"headingInternational":472,"headingSupplementInternational":44,"subheadingInternational":44,"promoTextInternational":473,"destination_countries":474,"quickLinks":482,"footerLinks":483,"footerLinksInternational":522,"name":534,"tabName":535,"tabDataGtmTrack":536},{"dimensions":460,"alt":463,"copyright":44,"url":464,"id":465,"edit":466},{"width":461,"height":462},88,24,"Monotype Evri Send Logo","courier-service-glasgow.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":59,"y":59,"zoom":58,"background":467},